          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Object Lesson"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "If a creature touches or physically interacts with the mimic while the mimic is transformed using Mimic Object, the mimic can spend its reaction to automatically give the creature the grabbed condition from its adhesive ability. The creature doesn't get to attempt the saving throw against this effect. The mimic then makes a pseudopod Strike against any creature adjacent to itself. Object Lesson can't be used again until the mimic escapes and takes on a new disguise."
            },
